Package: opendirectory
Architecture: darwin-arm64
Priority: required
Depends: corefoundation, libsystem, libxpc (>= 0-2)
Description: Open Directory client framework (CFOpenDirectory)
 CFOpenDirectory is the C interface to the directory service daemon. It
 looks up users and groups, checks and changes passwords, and edits
 directory records. OpenDirectory.framework re-exports it.

Package: opendirectory-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: darwin-arm64
Depends: opendirectory (= ${binary:Version})
Description: Open Directory client framework (CFOpenDirectory): development files
 Headers for building against CFOpenDirectory, with the C umbrella headers of
 OpenDirectory.framework and the DirectoryService type and constant headers.
